Date: Wed, 1 Jul 2026 16:49:16 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Neko LineageOS & AVIUM UI: introduce TEE Soft Emu

This feature is mostly a system-level integrate/adapt of [JingMatrix/TEESimulator](https://github.com/JingMatrix/TEESimulator)
It makes full use of existing path in Keystore, making it hard to detect (Patch mode only), also allow TEE-broken device
to use SOFTWARE-only attestation (GENERATE Mode, but easy to got detected)

